  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, two closed bulbs of equal volume<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;containing ideal gas initially of pressure <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> temperature <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>, which are connected by a narrow tube of negligible volume.<br /><br />To find the final pressure <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></math>, when one raised to&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>:<br />Number&nbsp;of moles of gas does not change,<br />&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>T</mtext></msub></mfenced><mtext>i</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>T</mtext></msub></mfenced><mtext>f</mtext></msub></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>i</mtext> </msub> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>i</mtext> </msub> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> <mtext>1</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> </msub> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> <mtext>1</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> </msub> <mtext>V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>RT</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>i</mtext> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mtext>1</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mtext>1</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>P</mtext> <mtext>f</mtext> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>T</mtext> <mtext>2&#160;</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>Pi</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">1</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>&#215;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mrow><mo>(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>"
